    "s03": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "page": "flows",
      "text": "Cut Paper. Flat confetti shapes as the brand pattern. Tangerine #FF7A00, sky #69B7FF, butter #FFD84D, grass #2FB36B on white, ink #111. Unbounded + Inter. Most festive; risk is noise, so content areas stay plain white.",
