      "x": 1520,
      "y": 980
    },
    "seo1": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "page": "landing",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "SEO · Home  /\nTitle: Custom Song Gift With Their Name | openyoursong\nDescription: A personalized song gift made from your story, with their name sung in it. Hear a free preview, then send it on the day. From $29.\nH1: A custom song gift with their name in it\nMain keys: custom song gift, personalized song gift (personalised song gift for GB/AU), custom song\nAlso in copy: song with their name, custom song examples, how much does a custom song cost (FAQ)\nSchema: Product + FAQPage",
      "w": 760,
      "x": 5040,
      "y": 0
    },
    "seo2": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "page": "landing",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "SEO · Pricing  /pricing\nTitle: How Much Does a Custom Song Cost? $29 | openyoursong\nDescription: A personalized song with their name costs $29, or $55 with a second version, photo slideshow and lyrics poster. Free preview before you pay.\nH1: How much does a custom song cost\nMain keys: how much does a custom song cost, song gift, custom song price\nSchema: Product with Offer, FAQPage",
      "w": 760,
      "x": 5040,
      "y": 1040
    },
    "seo3": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "page": "landing",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "SEO · Occasion  /occasions/mothers-day (GB: personalised, US: personalized + Mom)\nTitle: Mother's Day Song With Mum's Name | openyoursong\nDescription: A personalised Mother's Day song for Mum, made from your story and sent on the day. Free preview, then $29.\nH1: A Mother's Day song with Mum's name in it\nMain keys: mother's day song, song for mum / song for mom, personalised song gift\nSame template for /occasions/{birthday, anniversary, wedding, fathers-day, valentines-day, retirement} and /for/{wife, husband, mom, dad, …}; each page needs its own audio example",
      "w": 760,
      "x": 5040,
      "y": 2080
    },
